IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Vediamo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ascoltare la stessa
